              </p>
              <p className="mt-2 font-black">Solution:</p>
              <p className="font-serif text-base italic">
                xM = (-2 + 6) / 2 = 2
              </p>
              <p className="font-serif text-base italic">
                yM = (5 + -3) / 2 = 1
              </p>
              <p className="mt-2 inline-block rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 text-emerald-700">
