          </span>
        </a>
        <div className="text-center text-[9px] text-[#52627e]">
          ● ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○<br />
          <b>Lesson 24 of 60</b>
        </div>
        <a href="/lessons/geometry/202-attach-detach-point" className="text-right text-xs font-black text-blue-700">
